<title>HONG KONG: CIBC sets Cheung Kong group warrants.</title>
<headline>CIBC sets Cheung Kong group warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce said on Tuesday it launched 280 million American-style call warrants on a basket of shares of Cheung Kong group companies.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p>  Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd	0.125 shrs</p>
<p>  Hongkong Electric Holdings Ltd  0.285 shrs</p>
<p>  Hutchison Whampoa Ltd	     0.1   shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$21.9441   PREMIUM	    12.45 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.4031    GEARING	    5.73X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  07.JAN.98    MIN EXER LOT     10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    SPOT REFERENCE   HK$23.099</p>
<p>NOTE: CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT ISSUER'S OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
